Package: aztek
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Simon Legrand <srlegrand@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/srlegrand/AKA-Crest-Aztek
Depends: @SHLIBS@, libvulkan1, qt6-qpa-plugins, hicolor-icon-theme
Recommends: mesa-vulkan-drivers
Description: Modelling, UV, rigging and animation application
 Aztek is a modelling, UV, rigging and animation application, with MEL and
 Python scripting and .ma files. The viewport needs a Vulkan driver: the NVIDIA
 driver's own, or Mesa's.
